## 🎯 Optimization Impact Matrix

| Optimization | Case(s) | Time Saved | Implementation Complexity |
|--------------|---------|------------|---------------------------|
| **Context-aware routing** | Case 4 | 7.59s (25%) | ✅ Low - Already implemented |
| **Parallel task execution** | Case 5 | 45.2s (60%) | ✅ Low - Already implemented |
| **Streaming responses** | All | UX only* | 🟡 Medium - Requires frontend changes |
| **Routing cache** | 1, 3, 4 | ~2-4s (10-20%) | 🟡 Medium - Need cache invalidation logic |
| **Smaller routing model** | All | ~2-3s (20-50%) | 🟢 High - Model swap + accuracy testing |
| **Direct execution** | 3, 4 | ~8-12s (30-40%) | 🔴 Very High - Bypass LLM iterations |

*Streaming doesn't reduce actual time but improves perceived performance

